rcise the new scenario. All prior manifest and coverage objects remain byte-for-byte intact; measured fixture fences retain their existing margins. This adds partial conformance evidence only—no runtime, public profile advertisement, or release change.\n\nValidation: typecheck, build, formatting, lint, dependency boundaries, unchanged Read evidence verification and eight selected static callbacks passed. Four fresh packed-package cohorts passed: the positive sequence scenario, its successful-middle-delete control and both existing cross-carrier controls. They observed623 HTTP exchanges and71 child closures; these are workload counts, not profile qualification. The cumulative report still exposes241 catalog scenarios without executable plans.\n\nNative review and preservation audits are complete. Actual Claude review is pending: the first attempt timed out without output and a reduced-context review is running. This PR remains draft until that review is dispositioned and exact-head CI passes. No release or Preview2 promotion.\n","created_at":"2026-10-15T17:34:37Z","updated_at":"2026-10-15T17:34:37Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"6bb108b532ebda037ba63725f35b3a925048f2c6","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gastownhall/bdp/pulls/132/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gastownhall/bdp/pulls/132/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gastownhall/bdp/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gastownhall/bdp/issues/132/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gastownhall/bdp/statuses/82f60a25da8799334381f6ebd810f32a3574cd2d","head":{"label":"gastownhall:codex/vickie-sequence-member-transactions","ref":"codex/vickie-sequence-member-transactions","sha":"82f60a25da8799334381f6ebd810f32a3574cd2d","user":{"login":"gastownhall","id":255961667,"node_id":"O_kgD